      "text": "Starlink beams are turned off over India, so the claim that they were used by anyone for any reason is absolutely false",
      "quote": {
        "author": "cb_doge",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1498070100393754625/C2V-fbll_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-08 04:22:42",
