      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "Starlink in India would enable high-speed, affordable Internet connectivity for those who can’t afford current prices or who don’t have a connection at all!",
      "quote": {
        "author": "cb_doge",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1498070100393754625/C2V-fbll_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-08 01:23:49",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-07T17:23:49.000Z",
        "id": "2107884615138767108",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2107884586973978624/img/JJFv1jloDjUVy18J.jpg"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "duration": 17.995,
            "height": 1080,
            "thumbnail_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2107884586973978624/img/JJFv1jloDjUVy18J.jpg",
            "type": "video",
            "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2107884586973978624/vid/avc1/1506x1080/wDgUuf089ekpQwOk.mp4?tag=29",
            "width": 1506
          }
        ],
        "name": "DogeDesigner",
        "text": "ELON MUSK: “We’d love to be operating Starlink in India. That would be great.”\n\nIt’s been nearly four years since Starlink applied to operate in India, and it is still waiting to launch.\n\nThe government should grant the remaining approvals as soon as possible so Starlink can bring high-speed internet to India’s remote and underserved communities.",
        "url": "https://x.com/cb_doge/status/2107884615138767108",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
