      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "Whatever it take for @Bot to deliver the best product experience for users",
      "quote": {
        "author": "farzyness",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1863976029368270848/NccgxqmW_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-08-28 21:54:34",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-08-28T13:54:34.000Z",
        "id": "2093336439819813198",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Farzad 🇺🇸 🇮🇷",
        "text": "Grok @bot will be insanely powerful if it’s completely model agnostic and the @SpaceXAI simply hyper-focuses on creating the greatest orchestrator AI of all time.\n\nThat orchestrator AI will know what model is best at what at the best possible cost and fastest speed, and based on your prompt, Grok Bot will automatically use the best model(s).\n\nAnd over time SpaceXAI can hyper-optimize their own models to be extremely good at executing tasks in Grok Bot.\n\nIt’s getting WAY too hard for humans to know which AI model is best at what already, especially at what cost and at what speed. The only way to do this properly is with another AI that automatically does all of this for you.\n\nAnd since SpaceX is gonna own so much compute, in theory, those other models will likely be served from their own data centers either on the ground or in space!\n\n$SPCX",
        "url": "https://x.com/farzyness/status/2093336439819813198",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
